# Design system (follow for all UI)

Full reference: [`docs/design-system.md`](docs/design-system.md). Living gallery: `/design` (`src/pages/design.astro`). Project memory (versions, content/skills/tools map): [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md). Tokens: `src/styles/tokens.css` (via `global.css`). Feature CSS: `hero.css`, `projects.css`, `testimonials.css`, `brands.css`, `skills.css`, `nav.css`, `utils.css`. Tools: `tools.css`. Gallery: `design.css`. Page scope: `site-root` + `--site-*` vars.

## Personality

Technical, craft-forward portfolio. Calm and precise — not loud SaaS marketing. Prefer matching existing section/element patterns over new visual languages.

**Avoid:** purple gradients, cream+terracotta editorial kits, broadsheet dense grids, glow stacks, emoji chrome, Inter/Roboto/Arial as display type, dashboard card grids on marketing surfaces.

## Layout

- Default content width: **`max-w-[550px]`** (home sections, footer, tools hub). Match footer when building hub-like pages.
- Tools author `~1100px`; markdown split `~1280px`.
- Breakpoint: `max-narrow:` ≤609px (`--breakpoint-narrow: 610px`).
- One job per section: one headline + one short muted support line via [`SectionHeading`](src/components/elements/SectionHeading.astro) on marketing sections.
- Top padding under nav ≈ `110–120px`.

## Color (semantic only)

Use `bg-bg`, `text-text`, `bg-surface`, `border-border`, `bg-primary`, `bg-inactive`, `text-text/60` (and `/50`–`/40` for meta). Primary `#2a29ff` and accent/active stay across themes; surfaces flip in `.dark`.

Borders: surface shells (footer, `.hero-card`, blogs list) use **`border border-border`** — not inset shadow (that makes the grey gap look tighter than the footer). Inset `shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--color-border)]` is for small chrome only (back circle, chips, `.hero-card-hole`, code). Minimal drop shadows (nav glass is the exception — `.nav-glass` in `nav.css`; mount from BaseLayout; no `transform` / `view-transition-name` / same-node `overflow: hidden` on glass).

## Type

- **Manrope 600** (`font-manrope`) for UI/marketing. Tracking ≈ `-0.04em` (titles `-0.05em`).
- **Fragment Mono** for code / raw markdown only.
- Scale: hero `70→48`, section `50→34`, body/CTA `17→15`, meta `13–14→12–13`. Text usually `m-0 p-0`.

## Shape

- Interactive chrome → **`rounded-full`** (CTAs, nav, search).
- Soft shells → `rounded-[45px]/[46px]` (mobile `[36px]`; blogs list stays `45px`). Inner solid boxes `rounded-[40→32]`.
- **Surface shell grey gap:** Footer is source of truth — `border border-border` + `p-[9→6]` (`pb-[18]` when a bottom bar sits in the shell). Same chrome on `.hero-card` (home / 404 / project) and blogs list. Never inset-shadow those shells. Full recipe: `docs/design-system.md` § Surface shell.
- Utility form fields → `14px` radius unless search (pill).
- Prefer surface shells + rows over generic cards. Cards only when wrapping a clear interaction (e.g. tools hub links).

## Recipes to copy

- **CSS home:** page content under `site-root`; feature sheets via `global.css` (`tokens`, `hero`, `projects`, …); layout/type/color in sheets via **`@apply`** (page-scoped `tools.css` / `design.css` need `@reference "./global.css"`); `--site-*` for layout helpers. Tools/gallery stay page-scoped. Nav chrome + SVG sprite live in `BaseLayout` (not per-page).
- **Surface shell:** copy Footer grey gap (`border-border` + `p-[9→6]`) onto `.hero-card` and blogs list — never inset-shadow those shells.
- **Section header:** [`SectionHeading`](src/components/elements/SectionHeading.astro) for centered marketing titles (not left-aligned tools/detail H1s).
- **Back control:** 52px circle + “Back to …” label (see blog/project/tools shell) — not plain “← text”.
- **Primary CTA:** pill, primary fill, optional scramble (`data-scramble` — hover on fine pointer, tap on touch).
- **Home / 404 / Project / Blog / Footer:** `/design` mounts live sections/pages with `preview` + dummy copy (`src/utils/design-preview-data.ts`). Media = gradient shell (`design-media-placeholder` + `.design-media-ph`); project thumbs = white **A** logo mark (`design-logo-placeholder`). Broken imgs → `image-fallback.ts`.
- **Nav gallery:** `/design` may mount in-flow `NavBar preview` inside `.design-nav-demo` (not a second fixed chrome). Theme toggle clips on `.nav-theme-toggle__clip`, never on the glass node; clip/track `pointer-events: none`.
- **Skill chips:** hover tooltip on fine pointer; tap-to-toggle `.is-open` on touch via `skill-tooltips.ts`. Clamp the bubble to the viewport so edge chips are not clipped.
- **Project:** sticky media cards (not blog list shell); project detail `.hero-card` uses footer grey gap; metadata rows; links bar; privacy page type.
- **Blog article:** left H1 + meta row + hairline + intro; body scale 38/22/18; disc/labeled/numbered bullets; `BlogCodeBlock` for fenced code; inline View all.
- **Markdown docs:** `data-md-doc="<id>"` + `MarkdownDocPanel`; optional `.md-doc-trigger`.
- **Tools:** register in `src/utils/tools.ts`; use `ToolsPageShell`; nested scroll → `data-lenis-prevent`.
- **Search:** `type="text"` + custom clear button (no native search cancel).
- **Private tools:** `noindex={true}`.
- **Gallery:** living previews at `/design`.

## Motion

Lenis page scroll; OSS Motion (`animate` / `inView` / `stagger`) for page-shell enter + scroll reveal; scramble on key CTAs; short `200ms` hovers. Don’t add motion noise. Honor reduced motion.

**Enhancements:** Motion tokens in `src/scripts/motion-tokens.ts`. Springs on interactive tools chrome still open (§12.2.3). **Verify Lenis vs native scroll** before locking the stack (§12.2.5). Prefer native View Transitions for page morphs. Replace custom scramble with Motion+ [`scrambleText`](https://motion.dev/examples/js-scramble-text) (§12.2.1) only with a membership. Keep at most one smooth-scroll approach; no GSAP theatre.
